        drivingExperience: "The 150hp ABC 2.6 V6 is the definition of a smooth, relaxed executive cruiser. It completely lacks the peaky, rev-happy nature of the 16V engines, instead relying on a buttery smooth, linear delivery of torque. In the heavy A6 C4 chassis, it is not fast, but it sounds excellent and provides a highly refined, whisper-quiet highway ride.",
