        timingType: "Belt & Chain (The primary drive is a toothed timing belt driving the exhaust camshafts. Internal chains with hydraulic tensioners at the rear of the cylinder heads link the exhaust to the intake camshafts. The tensioner pads are highly prone to breaking)", injectionType: "Multi-Point Injection (Bosch Motronic M3.8.2 sequential port fuel injection. Highly reliable and immune to carbon buildup)", engineLifespan: "350,000+ km (The iron block is bulletproof, but the 30V head introduces massive complexity. Lifespan is dictated by the maintenance of the cam chain tensioners and preventing catastrophic oil leaks)", turboType: "Naturally Aspirated (No turbocharger. Relies on the high-flowing 5-valve-per-cylinder heads to breathe exceptionally well at high RPMs)", ecuType: "Bosch Motronic M3.8.2 (Robust engine management with full OBD2-style diagnostics via VAG-COM)", euroStandard: "Euro 2", maxPowerStockInternals: "300+ hp (The bottom end is incredibly strong. Rare aftermarket supercharger kits (PES G2) used to push these to nearly 300hp reliably on stock internals)",
