        drivingExperience: "The 290hp AEC V8 provides an entirely different experience than the AAN Turbo. It is the definition of a velvet sledgehammer. Power is delivered in a completely linear, effortless wave of 400 Nm torque from idle to redline. The exhaust note is a deep, sophisticated V8 burble. However, when paired with the 4-speed automatic, it feels significantly slower and heavier than its 290hp rating suggests.",
