                "Oil Starvation (Clogged Pickup) - While less common than on the turbocharged 1.8T, infrequent oil changes can still sludge up the oil pump pickup tube, starving the top end of oil.",
                "Vacuum Leak Stranding - Severe tearing of the main intake boot or PCV system will draw in massive unmetered air, causing the engine to stall and refuse to idle.",
                "Heater Core Blockage - A common C5 chassis issue. The heater core clogs with silicate buildup, resulting in a total loss of cabin heat.",
