            timingType: "Belt & Chain (Toothed timing belt drives the exhaust camshaft; a hydraulic tensioner-driven chain at the rear of the head links the two cams. The chain tensioner is a frequent failure point)", injectionType: "Multi-Point Injection (MPI - Bosch Motronic M3.8.3. Features the highly desirable 'Big Port' head design from the AEB, which is a favorite for high-horsepower builds due to superior airflow)", engineLifespan: "350,000+ km (The AJL is an absolute tank. Based entirely on the legendary AEB architecture, it features forged connecting rods from the factory and thick 20mm wrist pins. With proper oil changes, it is nearly indestructible)", turboType: "Single Turbocharger (KKK K03. The AJL runs a slightly more aggressive factory boost map—approx 0.8 bar vs 0.6 bar—to achieve the 180hp output)", ecuType: "Bosch Motronic M3.8.3 (Cable-driven throttle, narrowband oxygen sensor control. Tuning requires physical EPROM chip replacement/soldering)", euroStandard: "Euro 2", maxPowerStockInternals: "450+ hp (The AJL is highly prized because of its 20mm wrist pins, forged rods, and 'Big Port' head. The block and crank can handle massive boost effortlessly)",
