            drivingExperience: "The 180hp AJL 1.8T in the A6 C5 is a surprisingly punchy highway cruiser. It feels noticeably faster and more eager to rev than the standard 150hp variants. The 'Big Port' head provides a very linear power delivery that makes the heavy chassis feel lighter. The 5-valve head creates a sophisticated induction note at high RPMs, and when paired with a manual gearbox, it offers a genuinely engaging classic Audi feel.",
