            drivingExperience: "The 130hp ALT engine in the large, heavy A6 C5 chassis feels remarkably underpowered. Designed as a budget fleet and commuter option, it provides smooth, quiet operation at city speeds thanks to the 20-valve head and variable intake geometry, but overtaking at highway speeds requires absolutely burying the throttle. If paired with the Multitronic CVT, acceleration is seamless but soulless.",
